:"-","url":"https://app.strato.nexus/","description":"EVM-compatible L1 blockchain with DeFi suite including CDP stablecoin (USDST), lending, AMM pools, tokenized precious metals, and cross-chain bridging. Built by BlockApps.","chain":"Strato","logo":"https://icons.llamao.fi/icons/protocols/strato","audits":"0","gecko_id":null,"cmcId":null,"category":"CDP","chains":["Strato"],"module":"strato/index.js","twitter":"strato_net","listedAt":1778867007,"methodology":"All values verified on-chain via sequential eth_call (no Multicall3). Swap pools enumerated from PoolFactory.allPools. CDP collateral read from CDPVault, lending deposits (idle liquidity + collateral) from LiquidityPool + CollateralVault, savings from SaveUSDSTVault, staked assets from SafetyModule, and vault holdings from the Vault botExecutor. Holder addresses resolved from on-chain registries (CDPRegistry, LendingRegistry). Outstanding LiquidityPool debt is reported separately under `borrowed` (totalScaledDebt × borrowIndex / RAY against the LiquidityPool borrowableAsset) and is excluded from TVL. CDP debt is not yet included because STRATO CDPEngine state mappings are not exposed via standard ABI auto-getters over eth_call; this will be added once an explicit on-chain view function is available. Prices resolved server-side by DefiLlama for the `strato` chain.","misrepresentedTokens":true,"tvlCodePath":"https://github.com/DefiLlama/DefiLlama-Adapters/blob/main/projects/strato/index.js","slug":"strato","tvl":16050685.064696006,"chainTvls":{"Strato-borrowed":4262.041088122542,"Strato":16050685.064696006,"borrowed":4262.041088122542},"change_1h":null,"change_1d":null,"change_7d":null,"tokenBreakdowns":{},"mcap":null},{"id":"1327","name":"Astar dApps Staking","address":null,"symbol":"ASTR","url":"https://astar.network","description":"Astar Network is a multi-chain decentralized application layer on Kusama Network. dApp staking is a mechanism that incentives developers who built in the Astar ecosystem. Users ca