n.io/","description":"For the past few years, MVL has successfully operated 'TADA', a fast-growing ride-hailing service in Southeast Asia, and 'ONiON Mobility', which develops and operates electric vehicle production and energy infrastructure. MVL is in the process of connecting this to the blockchain ecosystem. MVL Staking rewards are based on the actual business profits of TADA and ONiON. MVL uses Ethereum and BSC and has single staking and LP staking. It is divided into staking with daily rewards and staking with lock up","chain":"Multi-Chain","logo":"https://icons.llamao.fi/icons/protocols/mvl-staking","audits":"2","gecko_id":"mass-vehicle-ledger","cmcId":"2982","category":"Yield","chains":["Ethereum","Binance"],"module":"mvl/index.js","twitter":"mvlchain","audit_links":["https://skynet.certik.com/ko/projects/mvl-mass-vehicle-ledger?utm_source=CMC&utm_campaign=AuditByCertiKLink"],"listedAt":1710538502,"methodology":"MVL Single Staking TVL is calculated by multiplying the locked MVL quantity by the MVL price that changes in real time. MVL LP Staking TVL is calculated by multiplying the locked LP quantity by the LP price that changes in real time.At this time, the LP price changes depending on the prices of ETH and MVL, and the prices of BNB and bMVL.","misrepresentedTokens":false,"tvlCodePath":"https://github.com/DefiLlama/DefiLlama-Adapters/blob/main/projects/mvl/index.js","slug":"mvl-staking","tvl":0,"chainTvls":{"Ethereum":0,"Binance":0,"Ethereum-staking":87635.22485866373,"Binance-staking":1468.8019813838232,"Ethereum-pool2":329104.4265989837,"Binance-pool2":1493.0314433952196,"staking":89104.02684004755,"pool2":330597.45804237894},"change_1h":null,"change_1d":null,"change_7d":null,"tokenBreakdowns":{},"mcap":null,"staking":89104.02684004755,"pool2":330597.45804237894},{"id":"4322","name":"Blastex","address":null,"symbol":"-","url":"","description":"Blastex is the crypto Super Dex, powered by Blast, where you can explore the benefits of bonding and ETH stakin